OL,3,GNEWSACattle market's #12m revamp to get
OL,4,Aunder way
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction of a redesigned
OL,7,FLeicestershire food and drinks hub,
OL,8,Fwhich officials hope will give the
OL,9,Flocal economy a boost, is finally set
OL,10,Fto start.
OL,12,FMelton Borough Council's plans to
OL,13,Fregenerate the Stockyard in Melton to
OL,14,Fcreate a destination for market vendors
OL,15,Fand the creative industries have twice
OL,16,Fbeen delayed.
OL,18,FFunded with #12m from the government's
OL,19,FLevelling Up programme, the scheme was
OL,20,Foriginally planned to start in Spring
OL,21,F2026, but the council revised the
OL,22,Ftimeline last year.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
